[0.000, "o", "uild the closest clean thing you can, or, if it's a hard blocker, stop \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band say why. Either way record the gap i\u001b[44G a\u001b[47G`FEATURE-<slug>.m\u001b[65G` fi\u001b[70Ge in the project root: a\u001b[95Gon\u001b[98G-line title, the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`promis\u001b[12Gv\u001b[14Grsion` outpu\u001b[27G, what you n\u001b[40Geded and why the ta\u001b[60Gk cal\u001b[67Gd for it, what's missing\u001b[92G(e.g. no standard module for\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BX, no language support for Y),\u001b[34Gw\u001b[37Gther\u001b[43Gt\u001b[45Gblocked you outright or just forced a workar\u001b[90Gund,\u001b[95Gth\u001b[98G workaround you used,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band — if\u001b[12Gyou ca\u001b[19G — a **sketch of the API or syntax** th\u001b[59Gt wou\u001b[65Gd have made\u001b[77Git clean.\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mPut\u001b[7G`Please file\u001b[20Gthis upstream at \u001b[38Gttps://github.com/promise-\u001b[65Ganguage/prom\u001b[78Gse/issues` at the top of any such file, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwrite one file per distinct issue, and mention each in "]
[0.000, "o", "your summary so I remember to submit it. Only write these for \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breal failures and real gaps — don't invent them.\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m I'll start by learning the language from the toolchain.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shel\u001b[18G commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ promise guide > /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-xxxxx-prog-zoo-mini-git-mini-git-claude/27a900f2-a43e-4b95-bd87-c7\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m052de02092/scratchpad/guide.txt; wc -l /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-xxxxx-prog-zoo-mini-git-mini-git-claude/27a90\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m0f2-a43e-4b95-bd87-c7052d\u001b[32G02092/scratchpad/guide.txt; promise doc\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
