[0.075, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwrite it t\u001b[14G a `BUG-<\u001b[24Glug>.md` file in the\u001b[45Gproject root with a one-line title,\u001b[85G`prom\u001b[91Gs\u001b[93G version` output, yo\u001b[114Gr \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mplatform, the min\u001b[21Gmal repro\u001b[31G(smallest `.pr`\u001b[47Gsource plus the exact `promise build` command), the verbatim error \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Boutput, the expected behavior, a short table of what does and doesn't trigger it, your best guess at the cause, and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe work\u001b[12Grou\u001b[16Gd you us\u001b[25Gd \u001b[29G the real\u001b[39Gc\u001b[41Gde. Verify\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Grepro \u001b[63Gctually fails\u001b[77Gan\u001b[80G the \"compiles\u001b[95Gfine\" c\u001b[103Gntrols actually \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcompile before writing \u001b[27Ghem down\u001b[36G— do\u001b[41G't go from\u001b[52Gmemory.\u001b[39m                                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIf the task needs\u001b[21Gsomething Promise doesn't have yet — \u001b[59G standar\u001b[68G-l"]
