[0.000, "o", "ths all behave. Output is sorted everywhere;\u001b[108Gfailure\u001b[116Gcases\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprint\u001b[9Ga\u001b[11Gclear\u001b[17Gmessage\u001b[25Gand\u001b[29Gexit\u001b[34G1\u001b[36Gor\u001b[39G2\u001b[41Grather\u001b[48Gthan\u001b[53Gcrashing.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt did not compile on the first try\u001b[22m — three pars\u001b[52G errors, then a\u001b[73G of ownersh\u001b[85Gp/import\u001b[94Ger\u001b[98Grs,\u001b[102Gall with precise\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdiagnostics; once\u001b[21Git compiled, every subcommand was correct on the first run.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSeven files to submit upstream\u001b[34G\u001b[22m(each\u001b[40Gminimized,\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gcompiling\u001b[70Gcontrols\u001b[79Gactually\u001b[88Gverified):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
